Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:28.40,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Por isso, não se culpe tanto, estávamos todos errados
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.40,0:00:31.78,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Portanto, não carregue todo esse peso, como sempre faz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:35.78,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Sempre haverá algo que você não pode controlar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:40.16,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Vamos triunfar, sua salvação começou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.41,0:00:46.29,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Sem sinais, sem luzes, há tanta confusão
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.29,0:00:48.29,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,360)\blur1.95}Não destrua suas esperanças
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:54.05,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(360,360)\blur1.95}Você me faz perceber de quem eu preciso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.43,0:00:58.64,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,180)\blur1.95}Estarei lá, aguente firme, eles tentarão te mudar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:01.81,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Onde você está agora?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:04.44,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,80)\blur1.95}Te alcançarei ao amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.31,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,180)\blur1.95}As sombras aparecem
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.31,0:01:09.52,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Ilusões nascem
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.28,0:01:13.65,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,120)\blur1.95}Os anjos caídos que te acompanham não sabem
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:18.10,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur1.95}É a nossa dor que nos torna humanos, afinal
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:21.08,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,180)\blur1.95}Fotografias em sépia antigas mostram
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.08,0:01:23.08,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(180,110)\blur1.95}Nosso frágil mundo precioso
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:26.92,Owari OP BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,540)\blur1.95}Que descartamos ao responder o chamado
